* GitHub Dependabot
** Three features
*** Alerts: detection
*** Security updates: minimum fix
*** Version updates: dependabot.yml
** Components
*** dependabot-core: updater and gems
*** dependabot/cli: runs jobs locally
*** Credential proxy
*** Advisory Database
*** Private Dependabot API
** Update job
*** Fetch and parse files
*** Select an operation
*** Check, update, request a PR
*** Mark as processed
left side
** Choosing a target
*** Version: highest, 3-day cooldown
*** Security: lowest safe, no cooldown
*** Unlock: none, own, all
** Advisories
*** Passed in the job
*** Reviewed ones trigger alerts
*** Version ranges, no symbols
** Limits
*** Version matching only
*** No govulncheck
*** Reachability preview: alerts, JS and TS
** Trust boundaries
*** Internal network
*** No credentials in the updater
*** API creates the pull request
@endmindmap
